While Aldi is preparing to open two distribution centers and the first of more than 120 stores in southern and Western Australia early next year, Metcash and IGA supermarkets strengthen relations with local grocery suppliers and are building an IGA brand through marketing in mainstream and social media events such as the Adelaide show.
