Vašek's work of an illuminator for the film is not a guarantee of a regular reception.
That's why he sometimes drives into Prague's streets as a taxi driver.
At the age of sixty, according to his words, he physically manages to care for the finances of the family and children, but how long will it be so?
"I am aware that due to our age-apparent difference, it will one day be me who will feed this family," Eva admits frankly when questioning the future.
They would like to go back to work, but she is even more tempted by the possibility of her own business.
With four kids, I'm not a big deal for an employer.
